title: "Tip-Seal & Blade-Tip Architecture Study: Zero-Hole Labyrinth Shroud + Carbide Ring (Track A) vs. Open-Tip 22-Port Bleed Array (Track B)"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
authors:
  - family-names: "Singh"
    given-names: "Abhishek"
